          (the npm registry's "integrity" value, checked on download)
Files:    legacy/build/pdf.min.mjs, legacy/build/pdf.worker.min.mjs, LICENSE -- unchanged copies. The legacy build because
          the modern one needs very new browser functions (Uint8Array.toHex, Map.getOrInsertComputed) that older
          Android WebViews lack (2.48.0 device test).
Not bundled: cmaps, standard_fonts, wasm (only needed for rare CJK / non-embedded fonts / JPEG 2000 images;
          pdf.js falls back to the browser's fonts).
